{
  "slug": "spine-accordion",
  "name": "Spine Accordion",
  "description": "A shelf of work opened one piece at a time: closed pieces are thin spines with their titles set sideways, and the one you point at, tap or focus unfurls into a framed picture while the others close back; it stacks into rows in a narrow container. Copia adds arrow-key navigation, a picture that settles from a slight zoom, numbered spines and autoplay that pauses on hover or focus.",
